  "bio": "Chioko is a gifted tattoo artist based in London, United Kingdom, specializing in the art of realism that captures the essence of their subjects with breathtaking accuracy and detail. Clients are consistently impressed by Chioko's professionalism, which is evident in their meticulous approach to both the art and the client experience. To book an appointment with this talented artist, one must reach out via direct message or WhatsApp, as they operate by appointment only to ensure each client receives their undivided attention.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: London, England, United Kingdom"
